TITLE Albite kinetics with Fe2/Fe3 and fixed P H2S
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 0
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(2) 4
    Fe(3) 4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -temperature 200
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 10 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step pe
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, -LA("e-")
END
